<title>USA: WHITING HAS SPENT $22.2 MLN ON ACQUISITIONS.</title>
<headline>WHITING HAS SPENT $22.2 MLN ON ACQUISITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Whiting Petroleum Corp said Wednesday it has closed oil and gas acquisitions totaling $22.2 million to date in 1997.</p>
<p>The IES Industries Inc subsidiary said it acquired properties in the states of Texas, Louisiana, Wyoming and Michigan in four separate transactions which will add an estimated 260 barrels of oil and 6.8 million cubic feet of gas daily to Whiting's net production.</p>
<p>Whiting said it continues to aggressively pursue attractive domestic acquisition opportunities, both onshore and in the Gulf of Mexico.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
